flowchart LR
    Q[Exact question] --> R[Find five likely conversations]
    R --> READ[Read likely places]
    READ --> CLAIM[Qwen: one small claim plus evidence IDs]
    CLAIM --> CODE[Code restores the exact quote]
    CODE --> NLI[DeBERTa checks quote plus nearby source text]
    NLI -->|supported| PILES[Put matching claims on the same shelf]
    NLI -->|not proven| STOP[Do not use it]
    PILES --> CLEAN[Qwen makes each shelf readable]
    CLEAN --> CHECK[Check the rewrite both ways]
    CHECK --> FINAL[Write only from checked shelves]
    FINAL --> USER[Answer the owner]

    REMOTE[Future remote pocket i] -. owner approval and secret removal .-> CLAIM
    USER -. later: value feedback .-> REMOTE
